error[E0086]: module 'const' 'k' has no initializer; a 'const' must be given its value (§10.1)
  --> check_module_cell_no_zero_value.bit:28:7
   |
28 | const k: Outer
   |       ^ write `const k = <value>`; only a 'let' may be left to its zero value (§11.11)
error[E0086]: module 'const' 'n' has no initializer; a 'const' must be given its value (§10.1)
  --> check_module_cell_no_zero_value.bit:29:7
   |
29 | const n: int
   |       ^ write `const n = <value>`; only a 'let' may be left to its zero value (§11.11)
error[E0083]: 'Outer' cannot be default-constructed: field(s) with no zero value: 'inner'
  --> check_module_cell_no_zero_value.bit:25:5
   |
25 | let c: Outer
   |     ^^^^^^^^ give the binding an initializer naming them, e.g. `= Outer{ ... }` (§13.4)
error[E0083]: '(i64, Outer)' cannot be default-constructed: member .1 has type 'Outer', which has no zero value
  --> check_module_cell_no_zero_value.bit:26:5
   |
26 | let p: (int, Outer)
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ give the binding an initializer naming every member, e.g. `= (...)` (§13.4)
error[E0083]: 'Shape' cannot be default-constructed: its zero tag names 'Circle', which carries a payload and has no zero value
